#: e78ed220bda34961989403c947b9dea6 ebc48acc83b0456da66da176988347ca
#: fffbcdaca0a64d3cba1984d70440c403
msgid ""
"**BEC**: Battery Elimination Circuit. A voltage regulator found in ESCs (see"
" below) and as a stand-alone product. Designed to provide constant 5v "
"voltage for RC equipment, autopilots and other onboard electronics."
msgstr ""
"**BEC**：电池消除电路。在 ESC（见下文）中以及作为独立产品的稳压器。设计用于为 RC 设备、飞控和其他机载电子设备提供恒定 5V 电压。"

