#: fd353eaa579c47babbe46747e099ed1d
msgid ""
"**Firmware**: The software or sketch that is loaded into the non-volatile "
"memory of microprocessor based products. It is called 'firmware' because it "
"stays in the non-volatile memory even if power is removed - thus 'non' - "
"volatile. In the case of the autopilots, it is the 'program' or application "
"(App to smart phone users) that determines what the auto pilot does, and "
"how."
msgstr ""
"**固件（Firmware）**：加载到基于微处理器产品的非易失性存储器中的软件或程序。称为「固件」是因为即使断电，它仍保留在非易失性存储器中——因此是「非」易失性的。对于飞控而言，它是决定飞控做什么以及如何做的「程序」或应用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:92
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:96 0c11f1dc451a4ad59551c83adb4844e0
#: 21026a00760c4816b37a2681159b72d3 2e313a55e7c0420abf8b73ad351b8238
#: 3baf9ec204fb4673aff8ca1ff65a52f4 3bddb3c218a34d878efec4548e9e452a
#: 5a43f97379b94ece9ae8818f2965c73b 7d687b59f89a4fb3a321a050bc5e7763
#: d0804e87a9654c33bc76ba0019fedbcc e81d4a005ffb4e51a9e3091f7fa5c223
#: ec276e4da92349be9bd97c1cd8f33b6a fb04ec9d11264bf59e0df83ce3978772
#: ff547c03b37b4746bdf4f41b7a748aaf
msgid ""
"**FPV**: First-person view. A technique that uses an onboard video camera "
"and wireless connection to the ground allow a pilot on the ground with video"
" goggles to fly with a cockpit view."
msgstr "**FPV**：第一人称视角。一种使用机载摄像头和无线连接到地面的技术，使地面上佩戴视频护目镜的飞手能够以驾驶舱视角飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:100
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:96 019576935d724790b56c4bf2ab8c6221
#: 099d64ea4b6541c485aa37e291fce6e7 0bbdfb3e044e45caaf0533d9450f383f
#: 0c2748a14e9c459faef896f5e3ad28c8 10c2f21eed37432ab891c3ecf873c2a4
#: 6eff05c96a8c4ca08d0dafbb079b5097 7b641640733245e0a7c5e959f9c17a82
#: 8f931541fb53444c9ea7cb37c0bf1c50 8f98b3d9b00a4f7583f32a2eaeac4ec1
#: ac012f5e8bca42fb852bbe9ab344dff4 ac628eadcbde40b586b870a4ec722b54
#: bb0ea6abef394efb8fdbb833179989c4
msgid ""
"**FTDI**: A standard to convert USB to serial communications. Available as a"
" chip for boards that have a USB connector, or as an \\ `adapter "
"<https://www.amazon.com/ftdi-adapter/s?k=ftdi+adapter>`__ to connected to "
"breakout pins. FTDI stands for Future Technology Devices International, "
"which is the name of the company that makes the chips."
msgstr ""
"**FTDI**：将 USB 转换为串行通信的标准。作为芯片提供给有 USB 连接器的飞控板，或作为连接到排针的\\ `适配器 "
"<https://www.amazon.com/ftdi-adapter/s?k=ftdi+adapter>`__。FTDI 代表 Future "
"Technology Devices International，这是生产这些芯片的公司名称。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:102
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:106 0f3cb33abb0f47bf98ae98e66b2c58d5
#: 3634f5a25ed646a88c5ceadd6824253a 36700095b5284fc5b2a25e5ff05456f4
#: 5e5d2091f647407ba9dfaaa7046a5e6d 7b097c47cf1c4ad6b68720c15e0f48b5
#: 80aafb86118445df8dec05e022fb0f48 80cd62c757e34ff78d127ac7e3197962
#: b852b632038147cd9068b98f6808e570 cbb911d4da944ebc973ff1bca53be835
#: d77d3266aa174f1aa1c4ff382a6feecb e6cc45211ccb4bc0a872d2f4de51d926
#: f89ced7de0b64137b6627f1a4eacc233
msgid ""
"**GCS**: Ground Control Station. Software running on a computer on the "
"ground that receives telemetry information from an airborne UAV and displays"
" its progress and status, often including video and other sensor data. Can "
"also be used to transmit in-flight commands to the UAV."
msgstr ""
"**GCS**：地面站。在地面计算机上运行的软件，从空中 UAV 接收数传信息并显示其进度和状态，通常包括视频和其他传感器数据。也可用于向 UAV "
"传输飞行中命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:107
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:111 1fe65c8161b84f8cbc1ccaf908908920
#: 200cfc3579ee418c9d6d42d572d59ffd 2d834284bb1e4b95b102778322e99a63
#: 3137f42fafc34233b815c015140ef56d 37da20ddbbe14d8aa1d3b8ec86645aa8
#: 4a4f3e0537cf4058bfdd87d7585cd5f6 58dd40c865b84d18bc7e7fa72173ec85
#: 629fb6cd8aeb44a2a1d4b85640869cd6 7e24762467014defa338c3b53d635399
#: df2e5692e57c4fc2af5ad8c119252834 df4c0483bda34220a97bd5639e48fcb8
#: f6997bf4a5064211b715f657c7910f22
msgid ""
"**Hard Iron magnetic distortion**: distortions that arise from magnets or "
"magnetized metals on the airframe that affect the compass. These distortions"
" remain in the same location relative to the compass for all heading "
"orientations. These distortions can be mostly compensated for by adding "
"constant offsets to the values returned from the 3d magnetometer (compass)."
msgstr ""
"**硬铁磁性干扰**：机架上的磁铁或磁化金属对罗盘产生的干扰。这些干扰在所有航向方向上相对于罗盘保持在相同位置。通过向三维磁力计（罗盘）返回的值添加恒定偏移量，可以基本补偿这些干扰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:114
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:118 0c7a0a8195574316b00882a7e7f76009
#: 1022be35dcb9428cbb1ac37f17674ba8 1ad908270ec4418bb72bc1057f357c35
#: 1c760ce001404d65a36e8fcb7f713af7 5e2a4447da9143d69ddf25bb9fcdb445
#: 658de1b72f5c44d69b050a76c13dbe87 65b4d4db42b24f3e914f051c30740aa8
#: a4cf0efb10554755b08fc0152a72c87d b631b45a7d794a56a5e1b53877355f9c
#: b8a919e54b9047ef81bca47aea2fb88b e2cc62d8d13f45949736b5f072585af3
#: e821b31908ac496d83fd35ed85963427
msgid ""
"**HIL (Hardware-in-the-loop simulation)**: Doing a simulation where software"
" running on another computer generates data that simulates the data that "
"would be coming from an autopilot's sensors. The autopilot is running and "
"doesn't \"know\" that the data is simulated, so it responds just as it would"
" to real sensor data. Hardware-in-the-loop uses the physical autopilot "
"hardware connected to a simulator, as opposed to simulating the autopilot in"
" software, too. In an \"open loop\" simulation, the software simulator feeds"
" data to the hardware autopilot; in a \"closed loop\" simulation, the "
"hardware feeds data back to the software simulator, too."
msgstr ""
"**HIL（硬件在环仿真）**：在仿真中，另一台计算机上运行的软件生成数据，模拟来自飞控传感器的数据。飞控正在运行且「不知道」数据是模拟的，因此它的响应与对真实传感器数据一样。硬件在环使用连接到模拟器的物理飞控硬件，而不是在软件中模拟飞控。在「开环」仿真中，软件模拟器向硬件飞控输入数据；在「闭环」仿真中，硬件也将数据反馈给软件模拟器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:125
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:129 022bbfd5013c4165a1e218e9ead34cf7
#: 49695d636cb4460b9834fe45e8815d03 6c24243d234a475296078d78441d6630
#: 7a01f4b21e4d433bb1a3d00ef874c724 864fc2bbedae4925af0e2ca4aece49dd
#: 8b05e7bca4ed43bda89aefb58315fab8 8f573e4b1d1e416eb8f5564b254d1ccc
#: a81700dd9cda4fcfad61644be4327d37 b50640bec1d34b34b53cc55e17c2a390
#: b726e0589ec8490ca1b391ac01e30616 ec1176eb46024b20a790e3a4be862975
#: ef70798dbaac458b9a2ca6e8d2e374a5
msgid ""
"**I2C**: A serial bus that allows multiple low speed peripherals, such as "
"sensors, to be connected to a microprocessor. See \\ `this "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I%C2%B2C>`__ for more."
msgstr ""
"**I2C**：允许多个低速外设（如传感器）连接到微处理器的串行总线。\\ `详见此处 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I%C2%B2C>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:129
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:133 3d84530b380848d9966badd53a10c689
#: 3f6b9999aeb94eb89f4f9ded514b9f11 4694e05a6cba4a3bb4a84f9f2f4f3f03
#: 613759dede884125a64f66a5f6939649 9783da7b735e419f8e864a050b805e9e
#: b12f6cfb302a429791656b54b68f5a3a d07a011f4bce428dab826c8c0859104b
#: e78253d0bfc54de9bfd5ef00777b980f e7d12af7e2264eeabcc7e4fcae251462
#: f7f067a7efe6467cba6f71ad894fd778 fb59668503314e0d96dc3f570f4932fb
#: ff06f1566f9b44078df48950c3a55ce0
msgid ""
"**IDE**: An integrated development environment, such as the \\ `Arduino "
"<https://www.arduino.cc/en/Main/Software>`__ editor/downloader/serial "
"monitor software. Often includes a debugger."
msgstr ""
"**IDE**：集成开发环境，如\\ `Arduino <https://www.arduino.cc/en/Main/Software>`__ "
"编辑器/下载器/串行监视器软件。通常包含调试器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:133
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:137 000431573caa4f04aac6a934d8d7ff2d
#: 09801ae758724e3ebf67de8087769dda 5e53c90c45484962b49bb2c76c2ab2c3
#: 6e4f72f5a7ee49aca31154866cb1a0ff 861064001f0a414ca58435d6ea41b92e
#: 8e6e5e185ee54d25a400051e65be4690 91354201d5e94bfebac2a10f48a668c8
#: a631559e60ad482a9283a8ca4fe8c616 d67f8b89e8684f5a97b18d9e0c08399d
#: e5497f4bf42c4ea7b3fadfac7336c439 e5c79104a4d34ee881b4c028d3d9780c
#: fa0f2e71b7824b2e9b807b34fe5fdca1
msgid ""
"**IMU**: An inertial measurement unit such as the ArduPilot OilPan. Usually "
"has at least three accelerometers (measuring the gravity vector in the x,y "
"and z dimensions) and two gyros (measuring rotation around the tilt and "
"pitch axis). Neither are sufficient by themselves, since accelerometers are "
"thrown off by movement (ie, they are \"noisy\" over short periods of time), "
"while gyros drift over time. The data from both types of sensors must be "
"combined in software to determine true aircraft attitude and movement to "
"create an AHRS (see above). One technique for doing this is the Kalman "
"filter (see below). Now superseded by Autopilots which include CPU and "
"sensors in one unit."
msgstr ""
"**IMU**：惯性测量单元，如 ArduPilot OilPan。通常至少有三个加速度计（测量 x、y 和 z "
"方向的重力向量）和两个陀螺仪（测量绕倾斜和俯仰轴的旋转）。两者单独使用都不够，因为加速度计受运动干扰（即短时间内「噪声」大），而陀螺仪会随时间漂移。两种传感器的数据必须在软件中结合以确定飞行器的真实姿态和运动，从而创建"
" AHRS（见上文）。卡尔曼滤波器（见下文）是一种实现这一点的技术。现已被将 CPU 和传感器集成在一个单元中的飞控所取代。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:145
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:149 17541574cb0d4a5cbe28069731cd81e7
#: 3aefa1fa832e42ed9cdf600a26dc3ba2 465888cbf0eb48e7bbee1ea19682ed73
#: 5961e050cb754ec49ba06aa9f5df68f0 5b81b9b0dba4491ab80cfa89ca060f8b
#: 64438a5f86f54352b4e13b5e20712f8f 741a236539494c40ab640545a28c53e3
#: 86ed3ce8c40a460894397cf91b77cd36 8f08b642e14543118c1800a62caed3b0
#: 9deb480c2aea44d88ad26bf1560f6e73 b4113ea2410849bda31ee35db70baeeb
#: f2d6acca5be4437daec6f26af496dac4
msgid ""
"**Inner loop/Outer loop**: Usually used to refer to the stabilization and "
"navigation functions of an autopilot. The stabilization function must run in"
" real-time and as often as 100 times a second (\"inner loop\"), while the "
"navigation function can run as infrequently as once per second and can "
"tolerate delays and interruptions (\"outer loop\")."
msgstr ""
"**内环/外环**：通常指飞控的稳定和导航功能。稳定功能必须实时运行，每秒高达 100 "
"次（「内环」），而导航功能每秒运行一次即可，可以容忍延迟和中断（「外环」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:151
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:155 1ae98290203d41dda9295b330c0b66b2
#: 3fc1aac8c0e241638ac8822ecd77d02d 563e8cb6f00b4874a25e0e7d38967877
#: 5eb4c8374e244c09a5787f57eb22ccab 6e022ecb89e64174b6a43fe3dcd7337c
#: 8143d27d08b24e0faf3b18ca1a3f5854 8a2e3bfd92ae4c998c267a3fcc866e33
#: bc1d0dd661ec48ca9d1df923c72e278e c78686248b5e4a07854b05c06659dcda
#: dde1c0cec0a240f8a021182fa4ac3d2f f8d551dd0ac547ce9ecd84f4337ae227
#: fff802551c8b41d69293f29d7f70d6b9
msgid ""
"**INS**: Inertial Navigation System. A way to calculate position based on an"
" initial GPS reading followed by readings from motion and speed sensors "
"using dead reckoning. Useful when GPS is not available or has temporarily "
"lost its signal."
msgstr ""
"**INS**：惯性导航系统。一种基于初始 GPS 读数，随后使用运动和速度传感器通过航位推算计算位置的方法。在 GPS 不可用或暂时失去信号时有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:156
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:160 0710c12786f64419bff5a73a0eefc548
#: 13f906ea2cf8470b809c4b2922ed563b 3d6beb47f9c34e91921f5862176af3dd
#: 46820d0eceae4816ab276c7387fe88b7 4d8b88aa27f147afa7c5ef877df1f366
#: 5c73d71c01e64bc6adb53b8b6e9b9aa2 769b156523124839829f4b9d35cda738
#: 76c86a5bc89040569c3b5dcfd00b138c 7de704687de64fbab6cb6d989d981ba8
#: bcf1c2556d8c4d56bdf4cf84a606274a c219b5836ecc49f7b7bc3cd09d439e56
#: e92d88b3feef4b998169a332fbb82b09
msgid ""
"**ICSP: In Circuit Serial Programmer**. A way to load code to a "
"microprocessor. Usually seen as a six-pin (two rows of three) connector on a"
" PCB. To use this, you need a programmer, such as this one, that uses the "
"SPI (Serial Peripheral Interface) standard."
msgstr ""
"**ICSP：在路系统编程器**。向微处理器加载代码的方式。通常在 PCB 上以六针（两排三个）连接器形式出现。使用此方式需要使用 "
"SPI（串行外设接口）标准的编程器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:161
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:165 1cfb1daebc1a4af0a44b92d0156a882e
#: 3e9d4ba9b90c4bf28331a4ce2fc6e942 4d359a3e02574e90a898ec00d42094ae
#: 50bf77c05fdb46249f45f04a0129b02c 517246fec4cb4757af0fda09ae0944dd
#: 69b80f7b251942c6afade66b264935f3 ca5625769ac04799895740eea1a1ab06
#: cbad75f021374476988144a35fca6062 d356d36282bb41f3982479e2824b253b
#: dd4ad9dfc7034ef39b1abba792b23d2d ed544cd395d14536b2ae679f4f452441
#: ed681e60d238427594dec2b2b21ed619
msgid ""
"**Kalman Filter**: A relatively complicated algorithm that, in our "
"applications, is primarily used to combine accelerometer and gyro data to "
"provide an accurate description of aircraft attitude and movement in real "
"time. See \\ `this <http://tom.pycke.be/mav/71/kalman-filtering-of-imu-"
"data>`__ for more."
msgstr ""
"**卡尔曼滤波器**：一种相对复杂的算法，在我们的应用中主要用于结合加速度计和陀螺仪数据，以实时提供飞行器姿态和运动的精确描述。\\ `详见此处 "
"<http://tom.pycke.be/mav/71/kalman-filtering-of-imu-data>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:168
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:172 1061e25a6e7e4af6acbbc20e3cefdffa
#: 24ad86d993914dccb87837ddfe70daf0 876b7f5f7d9d4b3cb183a11ba77e2af7
#: a0471f78fa0145199c96705972d58f0e b53e99a609374e59a6a0208eb217e748
#: c6586b8c4bee4c8ab3db61a42536ada6 cad1f4e83f284ab0828c06484c6f4cd2
#: e206f7fbcd7549e3983057e3d9aa9b5b e2323061f8564a90acc3a152e008bce3
#: e7c021b361d34436bbc0ecfd74fc421e f800a7c423f742a09646fb96bc99a197
#: fd575d859d0545d2b77cfab0011bca2e
msgid "**LOS**: Line of Sight. See VLOS below."
msgstr "**LOS**：视线。见下方 VLOS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:170
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:174 0057d3385a5640ba8835b5541b43d282
#: 0bcddbfee313456cbfe4ee8cb77430c8 1329ae4e6e4c4e5596d46df204ce3811
#: 1b3f28e4503343ce8364bb9e258ddd48 2cc5bfc31952474a98aa1a6b339235bd
#: 38afe63f255f46feb010d4963397fba8 7ca4bf689c6d44d7847ee804f59d0dae
#: a1df4f9dc90c4e51b97778491c3c796c c630c159aa3d43178a00f8ec663d951a
#: c93fbd7693a249bba128fddc9f9735d3 ebfe4fb4b54245cc9a0f64bd7e70fb7b
#: faf299e00ddc459d81a597d7ce8d3721
msgid ""
"**LiPo**: Lithium Polymer battery, aka LiPoly. Variants include Lithium Ion "
"(Li-Ion) battery. This battery chemistry offers more power and lighter "
"weight than NiMh and NiCad batteries."
msgstr ""
"**LiPo**：锂聚合物电池，也称 LiPoly。变体包括锂离子（Li-Ion）电池。与镍氢和镍镉电池相比，这种电池化学提供更多电力且重量更轻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:174
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:178 0842fd01ec394bf6b4b9e0b27e81ca9c
#: 275f2f9db2c74107ab24ad4121d66079 5e882a180f3b4380bb40567dd6ccd47a
#: 9c4928643ef24aa0a22a00ddc525fd9a a8893fb2b783457e8a73d96c0b55a36e
#: bdc3e1959ac7451ca3c2501c53fb59a3 ceb7b030ed4d415d8c6f289253c0f2dd
#: da7f4abf205c4c74a12ec5091841710e dc863eb1418a47e4a08daa88815be0a7
#: ddeb43ccc7b645fe8ea2f6f1ca3678fa f48d014d946c433c9dd8bae74d001728
#: f65cf3f35cfa4ea7908a580d8c43b6f2
msgid ""
"**MAVLink**. The Micro Air Vehicle communications protocol used by the "
"Copter and Plane line of autopilots. See \\ `here "
"<http://qgroundcontrol.org/mavlink/start>`__ for more info on MAVLink."
msgstr ""
"**MAVLink**。Copter 和 Plane 系列飞控使用的微型飞行器通信协议。\\ `此处 "
"<http://qgroundcontrol.org/mavlink/start>`__ 有更多关于 MAVLink 的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:179
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:183 2367fae5926d40f8aa05c6ebc8fdc2bd
#: 23f2a639c1d8486faba1c34d8d9654b7 2c807272f23148acb2c3b286835a1af6
#: 38cec01f88694255b49c86555e64308a 402fb240c9004d84aac8fdb84d734cac
