#: 874cf2108e5049bbb2ddf8e8398fb255 d2ecbe32fa1a42b88e269456bdc4e2b0
#: dc8061686a03445c984bdd0a996ce899
msgid ""
"**MAV**: Micro Air Vehicle. A small UAV. More \\ `here "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Micro_air_vehicle>`__."
msgstr ""
"**MAV**：微型飞行器。小型 UAV。\\ `更多信息 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Micro_air_vehicle>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:182
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:186 1a9f8c86e70b444da3c97036e15932aa
#: 323535dae04c433bbc12679474330fe1 35cbebd5d5bf4d5aa48096748fa4960b
#: 462fedb6fb1a400c9054ce3af088adb6 54ead0daaa374821813ed4771091004b
#: 817b8167bced41ecbe2fe7d632ef04b6 a39a0e8863d34913bb346dd9b6a11a78
#: a4d4003ef03348408e4578c36d53c536 cb87433d89014bbaa3cb596b533679d4
#: dc07a451a39240438bd0e1c862ad1a6c f00ba36346124ddca436f5ee8bb8f8ba
#: f3aed66b218f4c09baa10ca177fec11e
msgid ""
"**NMEA**: National Marine Electronics Association standard for GPS "
"information. When we refer to \"NMEA sentences\", we're talking about ASCII "
"strings from a GPS module that look like this: "
"$GPGGA,123519,4807.038,N,01131.000,E,1,08,0.9,545.4,M,46.9,M,,\\ **47**"
msgstr ""
"**NMEA**：国家海洋电子协会 GPS 信息标准。当我们说「NMEA 语句」时，是指 GPS 模块输出的如下所示的 ASCII "
"字符串：$GPGGA,123519,4807.038,N,01131.000,E,1,08,0.9,545.4,M,46.9,M,,\\ **47**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:187
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:191 190e5e996b86415f9a6b215b48e3c02c
#: 25fc15f9f94342b896b9e6d7db467731 435f9da39c684810a07f687ca59de04a
#: 672093424d404c42a046218cc4688fa1 6ecf1af24b3f4990be2f3c8558cd4748
#: 82a915afdd28466fa2ae2d89ff23bdb7 8ae156241b014c1c8b512c0c7e8f7ed7
#: acba3cf178734dbca165cd108c20db56 d0ab1176fba242ba98ccc59c29afc339
#: de5e3abb5dff493da0344cb649529005 fbd34533adba45478c0598f343dea788
#: fd6c3b6c6980454bb816f0e9d20cbf4d
msgid ""
"**Oilpan**: An arduino style shield meant to be paired with the "
"ArduPilotMega. Contained the majority of the sensors (gyos, accelerometers, "
"barometer, etc) that allow the ArduPilotMega to function as an autopilot, "
"now superseded by subsequent Autopilots that incorporate CPU and sensors in "
"one board."
msgstr ""
"**Oilpan**：一种设计为与 ArduPilotMega 配对使用的 Arduino "
"风格扩展板。包含大部分传感器（陀螺仪、加速度计、气压计等），使 ArduPilotMega 能够作为飞控运行。现已被将 CPU "
"和传感器集成在一块板上的后续飞控所取代。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:193
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:197 0b534ba0883b4a1aa3dd35847f8a0202
#: 1697f938adc748cab27f2b2c8b3d3c84 477f2b3f945241ba8da9bbe7ec372a46
#: 5a761899557747ecaed271f984c2bbac a2f88867b09d4aeb9c1bfe70b2f5cfbb
#: b83633d7a28747a48e5068e7d428b75d cb027be7c14e4e9b881c9c681d2e48bb
#: cef30c0e0e5141cead3648e66384ce2b eb77d881f3494af0942e32679965c6a0
#: f51a92ef40a84b67928913a886913cc3 f96f6d8b71ee471189b47606dbccede3
#: fc46208cea0e42d794eba38b3ad7caec
msgid ""
"**OSD**: On-screen display. A way to integrate data (often telemetry "
"information) into the real-time video stream the aircraft is sending to the "
"ground."
msgstr "**OSD**：屏幕显示。将数据（通常是数传信息）集成到飞行器向地面发送的实时视频流中的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:201 7099df506c4f408a8e402454c887fb78
msgid ""
"**PCB**: Printed circuit board. In our use, a specialized board designed and"
" \"fabbed\" for a dedicated purpose, as opposed to a breadboard or prototype"
" board, which can be used and resused for many projects."
msgstr "**PCB**：印刷电路板。在我们的使用中，是为特定目的设计和「制造」的专用板，与可用于多个项目的面包板或原型板不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:204
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:205 039ce47faaf440508a7ab7e655f89a33
#: 046356c53d3d4b0da147ff00c80e23fe 13e917e6b243426cb8428cfad782010f
#: 14bc929078104ad1bd79344d1b7ac5a9 17471d92ef824ac0865fb5948e947982
#: 34072032e2e345bdb518113734830775 bac31927d7ad485181c39f8b04adc4dd
#: c8f532b4a46647348eeb3729ce6877d0 e17ce872cc404bfa97e7591cffad4c14
#: e1d580786124469288293ce75c556549 ed52c41f5c8f4ba0b4b53fe62e919024
#: edfd0c6720364a04a0fa3732cbe5eac1
msgid ""
"**PCM**: Pulse Code Modulation: The technique some modern RC "
"transmitters/receivers communicate the RC channels information. It is "
"transmitted digitally using a digital code to represent the channel number, "
"position of the transmitter stick or switch, and sometimes other "
"information. Some modern RC systems also provide digital signals to control "
"digital servos - typically specific to each manufacturer."
msgstr ""
"**PCM**：脉冲编码调制：某些现代 RC 发射器/接收机传输 RC "
"通道信息的技术。使用数字代码以数字方式传输，表示通道号、发射器摇杆或开关的位置，有时还有其他信息。某些现代 RC "
"系统还提供数字信号来控制数字舵机——通常是特定于各制造商的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:211
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:212 0202c7674e104734bbf39529431363b5
#: 2206700d71c446a6ab271d79fd23d559 293daabac7aa4a439c7cece2eb345f03
#: 2ba5fdfa1cab4e019de1971869811aaf 2e66b5092cb64c9e9bdfc9b5e1632942
#: 429bfdfd38724167a493721900937104 511ac6add95d4fea95cf5edc8c1d8925
#: 701980839cf5455f81e4df13a552cb30 783d842af6654c37969950b108c68bdd
#: 80f4ca3d78f442f194a302c8ed378bfa c9a83966483e490d996850fa83cc82e2
#: d817f02839504908b71e84e7c269c200
msgid ""
"**PDB**: Power Distribution Board. A board used in multicopters to "
"distribute power to multiple ESCs."
msgstr "**PDB**：电源分配板。多旋翼中用于向多个 ESC 分配电源的板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:214
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:215 00646e18c6b14a44afc38bccfd80f93d
#: 15a29a78a5ee4573ba79fa465c182f48 45e178c093df4401a8eee21deb147062
#: 6d16d2ceeda948be874ed32d9eb02a05 741a41463ff842ad91f34bf4af9d45c2
#: bf3261ed14e842a59fd42fc1a51dc8d2 c8522e7f49734b6a92f9f45bcec6b512
#: de67d842d6a34206b211865fac576177 dee67cddc88845deaddc12bdbcc3e15d
#: e85325c2046d4bd6b61c82057a73258f eef538eaaeb941f6906692953ce010b1
#: f4e2629181484aecb8403dc362a59674
msgid ""
"**PIC**: Pilot in Command. Refers to a FAA requirement that UAVs stay under "
"a pilot's direct control if they are flying under the recreational exemption"
" to COA approval. See Line of Sight above. (Not to be confused with the PIC "
"processor series by Microchip)"
msgstr ""
"**PIC**：指挥飞行员。指 FAA 要求，如果 UAV 在豁免 COA 批准的娱乐性豁免下飞行，必须保持在飞行员的直接控制下。见上方视线。（不要与 "
"Microchip 的 PIC 处理器系列混淆）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:219
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:220 05479edde8a2406f936e120569ed716d
#: 156ea812c7604b0294de8750963c42a3 189bd39af6ff496eb32c9924d6233568
#: 3d1f66cb17384b14ae428da3029932df 45f30c2c80784d4f8d553ba1cba74773
#: 58cbd2e945e34dac9d5acd9d2fde58e4 63d13065a9df4876a6bad94b96a6cdf4
#: 91ddf0e8fcc84d5b819e70b782c87282 a42b5bb4f2d84daabfc94f6061a20487
#: cb1ced2e1b0d4255ba4a3b4ad267b852 e1b5d2f14b2842b19dbd84e41d691ecf
#: e1e391fe391e4b54a4c5009c08260821
msgid ""
"**PID**: Proportional/Integral/Derivative control method. A machine control "
"algorithm that allows for more accurate sensor-motion control loops and less"
" overcontrol. See \\ `this <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PID_controller>`__"
" for more."
msgstr ""
"**PID**：比例/积分/微分控制方法。一种机器控制算法，允许更精确的传感器-运动控制环路和更少的过控。\\ `详见此处 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PID_controller>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:224
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:225 680474b75aff43c0a271dc2f5b36956f
#: 7b7880c4ef7c4d5fb21e17e6910bc6d3 80eb2c83b11b4be89720719046a7a1e8
#: 8a6d2824c6bb4f12bdb29032665fbe50 8a8ad53492f84dc2933861d1247ad039
#: 9189a7f4e2364461bc0c3caeeee564fb c8c521790d8748c1bef0764c644d2655
#: da8188362288438d9b30a43e9f51fc6d e5058fc48dc846c3acc0008a94c2c850
#: e9edc06cce864366a9a70bd9b7735824 f9befca1b5bf4be09ca3ed8d13140ac3
#: fb56c501a39d414c85e8f53916be7deb
msgid ""
"**POI**: Point of Interest. Designates a spot that a UAV should keep a "
"camera pointed towards."
msgstr "**POI**：感兴趣点。指定 UAV 应将摄像头对准的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:226
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:227 35eabbb47548431aa79a23f8496e5ca2
#: 3f2e1e2fbc874f4a96924505af986682 4461722db75c46118524b0e19f349337
#: 9c8dba9c585f4b26a842d2e415aef195 9ffa9a2eee4445b9817d6625d144d15d
#: a0af0aa9813841a8bff42fafa9f9b641 a77f90f1599d488cac750d5e6f50d33e
#: c2ee6a9b5ec6463bb30be77718bd555f c57707428aad4847a802cfe54f5107f9
#: d32ebb68913b4c6ba3be76751d284c23 e9464a58d217463d95ed039f69941b65
#: fb14d5cc25a54c92af169bc77c3d5f8b
msgid ""
"**PPM**: `Pulse Position Modulation <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pulse-"
"position_modulation>`__. The square-wave pulse train used to transmit "
"multiple channels of information between some RC transmitters and receivers."
" Some RC receivers provide a PPM output (sometimes referred to as the PPM "
"Sum) which can be used on Pixhawk-series boards. Other receivers convert the"
" PPM signal and only provide PWM signals for each channel."
msgstr ""
"**PPM**：`脉冲位置调制 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pulse-"
"position_modulation>`__。某些 RC 发射器和接收机之间传输多通道信息的方波脉冲序列。某些 RC 接收机提供 PPM "
"输出（有时称为 PPM Sum），可用于 Pixhawk 系列飞控板。其他接收机将 PPM 信号转换并仅为每个通道提供 PWM 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:233
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:234 0ae7df4f559f46e6916ff4dd196630d6
#: 2292dff8a3ee48d89299bf1553d2b55d 32795a67f40e4f3d84b51eeaf740bc9f
#: 54ece7b417a143cc8397c18423fbed7f 78c9c82e71c147fd82e6193dbf2b06d3
#: 7aa0cd5838764af0af163b356bb5a7a5 9873d4f5692b43719d7ee8c2e10091f7
#: a06285955af149178a5532ceed13394f c434f66cbadf4c87b0b3491e7c8e5206
#: e4fd1a4c8e2b4d6da4abd0ed604430b0 ef2216ec69b243cba2f516af90efd99d
#: f3723d4252ad47618dd908b4cef6eb34
msgid ""
"**PWM**: Pulse Width Modulation. The square-wave signals used in RC control "
"to drive servos and speed controllers. There is one PWM signal for each "
"channel. The width varies from 1000 to 2000 microseconds, depending on the "
"RC manufacturer."
msgstr ""
"**PWM**：脉冲宽度调制。RC 控制中用于驱动舵机和调速器的方波信号。每个通道有一个 PWM 信号。宽度从 1000 到 2000 "
"微秒不等，具体取决于 RC 制造商。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:237
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:238 223b4f474fb24b5284912f06d4c8b9af
#: 50e3508da6624750ac5fd0676866c53f 5ee2153b25bb4285a010247357f36c86
#: 75082e3eae1b49bb973f7269dac9aeed 8108c427050649bea28debb03e9fbd8e
#: 832aadb7e4b143a6aecbfb2d694fa50d 87710c65984f4a039d3dcc95a3ea8e02
#: 992bd81b6be345089533e6333a40d360 ac7cc118d2664e5b862155eea0fe3929
#: af7220d7bfe344d7a0418ba620ba2005 d83b7a89fe9f42eda0cb93144e286861
#: fa896b1621ee420298506d3c7e817e17
msgid ""
"**PX4FMU/PX4IO**: First version of Pixhawk-series autopilots (FMUv1). "
"Discontinued."
msgstr "**PX4FMU/PX4IO**：Pixhawk 系列飞控的第一版（FMUv1）。已停产。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:240
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:242 231f67ad46384f53804f064223e64fa2
#: 2ca9924c9caa4635aafebe58fe79243b 3518cba2f8984525a4e6ca073bfb55fe
#: 4d03a151fb664b8b94291ebf5873458a 7a9348b9afa44e1aa055b458296fb9d8
#: 94a5d52cc75c4a68912101c273eb1273 a062e0562e164e6db52f3f9247c4e3d7
#: a9b3ed066a124973a5d3bd51028c3956 ac599cde899a4255886d10870a684420
#: b911016deb4242219c0fb37a44a662bb ceaf288c67644a6e838ad8fbd34b6043
#: f1808bc136a740fd92bb15fd961f13af
msgid ""
"**RTL**: Return to Launch. Fly back to the \"home\" location where the "
"aircraft took off."
msgstr "**RTL**：返回起飞点。飞回飞行器起飞的「Home」位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:242
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:244 50018b669a36493d8051aa69a392aa1c
#: 574215d920fd48ec95a24594572b194c 786e2c7c7f95423f9a7ce2668aa9df4e
#: 79dc87efa1e747fdbe9c1e6c576d415b 7cc01276f76745bf8cf604c031af2bb7
#: 8905ec514e3f40f3a260583464f46886 8db1880d81eb4aa684bdf92e7e439f6c
#: 9a1a14b962a0405eba3fd82ba52d534b c72e3cb940654abfb5b85e43e71c75b0
#: d860fd3e371548d8ab976b10de8aeb9a ddfe45ca989742e4b40bee8002e35e7f
#: faed8bab43a54877b382b92430dfac1a
msgid ""
"**SiRF III**: The standard used by most modern GPS modules. Includes !SiRF "
"III binary mode, which is an alternative to the ASCII-based NMEA standard "
"described above."
msgstr ""
"**SiRF III**：大多数现代 GPS 模块使用的标准。包括 SiRF III 二进制模式，这是上述基于 ASCII 的 NMEA "
"标准的替代方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:246
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:248 06bcd51985f9427aa6e889da29bea579
#: 0a5af6aaa02e4c098c3b7a10178b70e1 23639bcf31f548ee88608f7b3b28fbb3
#: 4e2938ff8ef54627925e6c001955a66f 6285242433ec4ef0b4e686aa81a697df
#: 838bddc3f0554751adee675006fdbc4d ace28c63a0d44b368a26e92d80fd477f
#: b69519c48c3d43e69608d6c55a55c4b5 c6bbf262a26f4a82b2ebdbad94f99d3b
#: c81d7289a249440e88880398682a8fa0 f6372d77f1ff4135b607cd8269a5b2de
#: ff485b8ab71f465b91f6e3e8e8f85dc5
msgid ""
"**Sketch**: The program files, drivers and other code generated by the "
"Arduinio IDE for a single project."
msgstr "**Sketch**：Arduino IDE 为单个项目生成的程序文件、驱动程序和其他代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:249
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:251 05755df7ae514dc2b25152b592447657
#: 18fbc94c62854243a629fa17e89f21ef 34757157d6cb4ae99c24bfc49c37d471
#: 4c493728e18d42dd92eeb272cf2b487b 58c5bbf4293c461c98163e94e18b3fcb
#: 7853f18f6c4846b8a758a2c21e3e3055 8899772c36b24df7b908f52159b2ab9c
#: a7bf6e9126824e88b4404ce20174768c b79aba76e24d450c9dee69a0b51b7ec4
#: cdd4a986066b49ffbd9da8e214980100 cf3cf3393bac49f18b73c541d5612951
#: e0846eff40fc45f9bca14b9dc19219bd
msgid ""
"**SVN**: Short for the Subversion version-control repository used by the DIY"
" Drones and other teams for source code."
msgstr "**SVN**：Subversion 版本控制仓库的缩写，DIY Drones 和其他团队用于源代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:252
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:256 09a89dde7f9b40b6b2a4ef8c0338c600
#: 21f27b84fde2444b8dde7e9e96196d88 4ffe97fd94434c399d8d687fbaa7bae3
#: 5668982066e8494a8e7d4e89343a4ee9 61fbfc239d5a4249bee72ca263f0c721
#: 74d4c053bf584af2b0adf77b3aad4278 999d36d0fb2a4156a96875984a28c6c3
#: a7f5282a209f4c7083809249080e4c59 ac0d8ac6ce254fcc91000021c2d97ea0
#: ae5728e9e75d4242afcdf6ed94992fcb cca941692236450abbd5ad3a7c131b31
#: d84621c925674ab4b01a4458427bcd6d
msgid ""
"**Telemetry System**: A two way radio system to allow flight data to be sent"
" from your aircraft and also to allow control or adjustment information to "
"be sent back to it from a \"ground station\", commonly a laptop computer. "
"See the :ref:`telemetry landing page <common-telemetry-landingpage>` for "
"options."
msgstr ""
"**数传系统（Telemetry "
"System）**：一种双向无线电系统，允许从飞行器发送飞行数据，也允许从「地面站」（通常是笔记本电脑）向飞行器发送控制或调整信息。选项请参见 "
":ref:`telemetry landing page <common-telemetry-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:257
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:261 02010f6b4ed143a68afa1cf98e0c3e83
#: 066d7007fdab4bf4a996b94b04ca4e50 2385ac5c08fa497b81fee714d064d3bf
#: 6c17a5d534cb460ea8b3f58d1a1a52c3 71f903d97f0440fbb28aa70356019ddc
#: 754ff39d909041fb88f2cf3427548878 93ad13f61c484b5d902209e677b8fddb
#: 9d171e6be6154d8fbff2a7f86c3a584c ac2aee03f7b24f01a438fd58f81affa8
#: b86c692910a64085943ac2c19c3acdfa c86a8af4a6234eb1acb829ca6f0359dc
#: de11111d45824ef883ab8fda323907ff
msgid ""
"**Thermopile**: An infrared detector. Often used in pairs in UAVs to measure"
" tilt and pitch by looking at differences in the infrared signature of the "
"horizon fore and aft and on both sides. This is based on the fact that there"
" is always an infrared gradient between earth and sky, and that you can keep"
" a plane flying level by ensuring that the readings are the same from both "
"sensors in each pair, each looking in opposite directions. These have been "
"largely displaced by electronic gyros and are no longer in common use."
msgstr ""
"**热堆（Thermopile）**：一种红外探测器。在 UAV "
"中通常成对使用，通过观察前后和两侧地平线红外信号的差异来测量倾斜和俯仰。这基于地球和天空之间始终存在红外梯度的事实，通过确保每对中两个传感器（各朝相反方向）的读数相同，可以保持飞机平飞。这些已基本被电子陀螺仪取代，不再常用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:266
#: ../../source/docs/common-glossary.rst:270 15506cd565404a75a7c7ae424b3866ff
#: 37783e771ced4b82b609126ff5332395 3fad6857bce243fdb8475155cfbe7fa6
#: 4ff6ad318c924253b1f95f29a99eb080 7c8637a07a15406d98e9779888d08d53
#: 865bd7a74f224858a2332bf4c8e21827 8a0e0722d7db404981fdaf63244bf48c
#: 989d1f3eeb534fe2a085954d390e2ef4 9aa84a9358f94871b6fe98e5e7101311
#: b29be5ccd2094429b80e7c11481f15fc e2eff053f68a48f0916fe3c5478239a0
#: e88f9849392444818ed1010b808651e3
msgid ""
"**UAV**: Unmanned Aerial Vehicle. In the military, these are increasingly "
"called Unmanned Aerial Systems (UAS), to reflect that the aircraft is just "
"part of a complex system in the air and on the ground. Ground-based "
"autonomous robots are called Unmanned Ground Vehicles (UGVs) and robot "
"submersibles are called Autonomous Underwater Vehicles (AUVs). Robot boats "
"are called Unmanned Surface Vehicles (USVs)."
msgstr ""
"**UAV**：无人飞行器。在军事上，这些越来越多地被称为无人飞行系统（UAS），以反映飞行器只是空中和地面复杂系统的一部分。基于地面的自主机器人称为无人地面车辆（UGV），机器人潜水器称为自主水下飞行器（AUV）。机器人船称为无人水面飞行器（USV）。"

