msgid ""
"**DCM**: Discrete Cosine Matrix. A algorithm that is a less processing "
"intensive equivalent of the Kalman Filter. See \\ `this "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/robust-estimator-of-the>`__ for more."
msgstr ""
"**DCM**：Discrete Cosine Matrix（离散余弦矩阵）。一种算法，是 Kalman 滤波器计算量更小的等效方案。更多信息见 \\ "
"`此处 <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/robust-estimator-of-the>`__。"

